'Win or Lose' Writer & Director Carrie Hobson and Michael Yates, along with Producer David Lally, break down Van's worst nightmare: a HIGH SCHOOL HOUSE PARTY. They discuss how the scene came together from storyboards to final frame and the lengths Vanessa will go to find her daughter, Rochelle. See more on THE PIXAR SHOW right here at YouTube.com/@Pixar ! 

